{"id":176,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"No records exist of Togetic being seen in the wilds. Rumors abound that it evolves under the loving care of a trusted human companion, upon whom the Pokémon then bestows great joy."},{"games":["Shield","X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It grows dispirited if it is not with kind people. It can float in midair without moving its wings."},{"games":["Sword","Y","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"They say that it will appear before kindhearted, caring people and shower them with happiness."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Togetic is said to be a Pokémon that brings good fortune. When the Pokémon spots someone who is pure of heart, it is said to appear and share its happiness with that person."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kind- hearted people."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is said to appear in front of kindly people to scatter a glowing down called “joy dust.”"},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It is said to be a POKéMON that brings good fortune. When it spots someone who is pure of heart, a TOGETIC appears and shares its happiness with that person."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Although it does not flap its wings very much, it can stay up in the air as it tags along after its trainer."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Hustle","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat but lowers its accuracy."},{"name":"Serene Grace","hidden":false,"description":"Raises the likelihood of additional effects occurring when the Pokémon uses its moves."},{"name":"Super Luck","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon is so lucky that the critical-hit ratios of its moves are boosted."}],"eggGroups":["Flying","Fairy"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":10,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"forest","color":"White","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":175,"name":"Togepi","condition":null,"children":[{"id":176,"name":"Togetic","condition":"Level up, High Friendship","children":[{"id":468,"name":"Togekiss","condition":"Use Shiny Stone","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[0,584],[1,1],[1,45],[1,186],[1,791],[12,204],[16,246],[20,281],[24,118],[28,495],[32,38],[36,219],[40,266],[44,226],[48,387],[52,273]],"machine":[213,226,34,280,204,605,409,577,227,203,263,126,53,374,19,248,416,447,257,270,63,304,286,113,345,25,5,118,595,417,583,182,94,473,240,115,156,514,496,219,247,214,684,173,76,211,500,164,241,129,86,161,271,253,526,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[814]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-81","name":"Togetic","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Common","number":"81","artist":"Teeziro","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-81/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-81/large"},{"id":"sv8-71","name":"Togetic","set":"Surging Sparks","date":"2024-11-08","rarity":"Common","number":"71","artist":null,"img":"sv8/71"},{"id":"sv3-84","name":"Togetic","set":"Obsidian Flames","date":"2023-08-11","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"84","artist":"Kyoko Umemoto","img":"sv3/84"},{"id":"swsh10-56","name":"Togetic","set":"Astral Radiance","date":"2022-05-27","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"56","artist":"Tika Matsuno","img":"swsh10/56"},{"id":"swshp-SWSH276","name":"Togetic","set":"SWSH Black Star Promos","date":"2019-11-15","rarity":"Promo","number":"SWSH276","artist":"Narumi Sato","img":"swshp/SWSH276"},{"id":"sm10-137","name":"Togetic","set":"Unbroken Bonds","date":"2019-05-03","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"137","artist":"sui","img":"sm10/137"},{"id":"xy6-44","name":"Togetic","set":"Roaring Skies","date":"2015-05-06","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"44","artist":"Kanako Eo","img":"xy6/44"},{"id":"bw8-103","name":"Togetic","set":"Plasma Storm","date":"2013-02-06","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"103","artist":"Akira Komayama","img":"bw8/103"},{"id":"hgss3-39","name":"Togetic","set":"HS—Undaunted","date"